<title>UK: BOE allots 401 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 401 mln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 401 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 214 million stg in bills outright and 187 million stg in 6.0 percent repos to April 3 and 4.</p>
</text>
